1
00:03:57,142 --> 00:04:03,142
Twitches Too is a drama, family, fantasy film directed by Stuart Gillard.

2
00:07:54,285 --> 00:08:00,285
Reunited witch twins Camryn and Alex adjust to their new life as supernatural beings while at the same time trying
to maintain a normal existence in this sequel to the magical Disney Channel original movie Twitches.

3
00:11:51,428 --> 00:11:57,428
But they soon find themselves going head to head with the forces
of darkness that threaten to destroy their world.

4
00:15:48,571 --> 00:15:54,571
Luckily, their birth mother, the powerful Miranda, is on hand to help out.

5
00:19:45,714 --> 00:19:51,714
Alex Fielding, played by Tia Mowry.

6
00:23:42,857 --> 00:23:48,857
Camryn Barnes, played by Tamera Mowry-Housley.

7
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:46,000
Miranda, played by Kristen Wilson.

8
00:31:37,142 --> 00:31:43,142
Thantos, played by Patrick Fabian.

9
00:35:34,285 --> 00:35:40,285
Karsh, played by Pat Kelly.

10
00:39:31,428 --> 00:39:37,428
Ileana, played by Leslie Seiler.

11
00:43:28,571 --> 00:43:34,571
Twitches Too is a 2007 American fantasy drama film
released as a Disney Channel Original Movie.

12
00:47:25,714 --> 00:47:31,714
It is the sequel to the Disney Channel Original
Movie Twitches, released in 2005.

13
00:51:22,857 --> 00:51:28,857
The film began production in late April 2007 and was released on October 12.

14
00:55:20,000 --> 00:55:26,000
It aired during Disney Channel's Halloween Month.

15
00:59:17,142 --> 00:59:23,142
The Disney Channel Original Series, Wizards of Waverly
Place, premiered following the film's premiere.

16
01:03:14,285 --> 01:03:20,285
The first trailer was released during the premiere of High School Musical 2.

17
01:07:11,428 --> 01:07:17,428
On its premiere night, the movie brought in 6.96 million viewers.

18
01:11:08,571 --> 01:11:14,571
For 15 years, it was the last non-musical Disney Channel Original
Movie sequel to be produced until  Under Wraps 2 (2022).

19
01:15:05,714 --> 01:15:11,714
The film explores themes of witch, sequel, missing parent.

20
01:19:02,857 --> 01:19:08,857
The tone is dark and emotional.
